      "content": "That's a good start for the tone. To make the debate more intense for the students, could you expand on the specific arguments they would have used regarding the 'social Darwinism' aspect? I want the essay to go into more detail about why they believed certain races were naturally more suited for governance and how that divergence in 'natural ability' made their intervention not just helpful, but a biological or historical necessity.",
